PatchApkWriter adapts the APK merge/alignment algorithm in Morphe Patcher 1.7.0
ApkUtils.kt (GPLv3), originally forked from revanced/revanced-library commit
06733072045c8016a75f232dec76505c0ba2e1cd. It adds physical-write progress callbacks.
Source: https://github.com/MorpheApp/morphe-patcher/blob/v1.7.0/src/main/kotlin/app/morphe/patcher/apk/ApkUtils.kt

Patcher uses Morphe Patcher 1.7.0 under GPLv3.
https://github.com/MorpheApp/morphe-patcher
Original patcher source includes code from:
https://github.com/LisoUseInAIKyrios/revanced-patcher
https://github.com/revanced/revanced-library
ApkMerger includes Apache-2.0 code by github.com/REAndroid (Copyright 2022).
No Morphe Manager source is copied into this plugin.

Android patch bundle preparation adds DEX to the original Rokid fork release;
it is a modified executable packaging, not a new or official upstream release.
The original source SHA-256 and prepared hash are retained in bundled.json.

